# Conformance probe pack used as an inner pack (spec 0.34):
# a fixed layout of two-byte words; only the first byte of the word is mapped. Public.
format     conformance-inner-word
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 2
bit_order  msb
field   probe.x  0:0:8  uint
